@startuml engine_activity

skinparam backgroundColor #D3D3D3

|Caller|
|Dispatcher|
|Handler|
|ScenarioContext|
|Model Builder|

|Caller|
start
:Submit command object;

|Dispatcher|
:Receive command;
:Route to handler;

|Handler|
if (Define or Derive Cmd?) then (Yes)
    |ScenarioContext|
    :Invalidate any existing\nScheduleResult;
    :Execute command\nagainst context;
    :Write result to context;
else if (Solve Cmd?) then (Yes)
    |ScenarioContext|
    :Validate context\nis complete;
    |Model Builder|
    :Read ScenarioContext;
    :Build CP-SAT model\nfrom context;
    :Solve;
    |ScenarioContext|
    :Write ScheduleResult\nto context;
else (Read Cmd)
    |ScenarioContext|
    :Read ScheduleResult\nfrom context;
    :Format result summary;
endif
|ScenarioContext|
:Return outcome to handler;

|Handler|
:Return outcome;

|Dispatcher|
:Return outcome to caller;

|Caller|
stop

@enduml